libhandoff
------------------------------------------
Facilitate limiting a program to a single instance per user

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libhandoff-devel-0.1-1bl2
  libhandoff0-0.1-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gtk-doc-1.37.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://web.archive.org/web/20171202030104/http://gpe.linuxtogo.org/

Canonical download:
  https://mucross.com/downloads/tonga-demo/sources/GPL/libhandoff/libhandoff-0.1.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libhandoff-0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libhandoff-0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libhandoff-0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhandoff-0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhandoff0-0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhandoff-devel-0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libhandoff)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libhandoff.README
  /usr/share/doc/libhandoff/ChangeLog

(libhandoff0)
  /usr/bin/cyghandoff-0.dll

(libhandoff-devel)
  /usr/include/handoff.h
  /usr/lib/libhandoff.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libhandoff.pc

------------------

